format-version: 1.2
data-version: releases/2026-10-06
remark: A tiny hand-written test fixture in MONDO's OBO format (tests/test_ontologies.py). The ids 9000xxx and their labels are made up; it is not an excerpt of MONDO.

[Term]
id: MONDO:0000001
name: disease

[Term]
id: MONDO:0700096
name: human disease
